        "created_at": "2015-02-23T23:17:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is pretty interesting.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For now I'm still focused on learning the characters and on thinking through how I would handle the way tournaments are doing drafts and bans, but if I ever get to a point where I'm just playing lots of skirmeshes w/out an eye on the tournaments, this would be a fun way to mix it up.</p>",
